NOTE ON THE FIXTURES

fixtures/vulnerable-api/ is DELIBERATELY INSECURE. It contains string-concatenated
SQL, unescaped reflection, an unauthenticated privileged route, permissive CORS
with credentials, no security headers and no rate limiting. It exists so the
security agent's detection rate can be measured against known ground truth.

Do not deploy it. Do not copy from it.
